# The SkoolKit disassembly is a separate work by David Thomas and is NOT
# redistributed here. Clone it into this path yourself -- see README.md.
#
# It also contains build/TheGreatEscape.pristine.z80, which is the original 48K
# game image. BUILD_PROMPT.md §2 and §10 are explicit that the tape image must
# not be shipped, so this directory stays out of the repo entirely.
/The-Great-Escape/

